weight-tracker
==============

Third-party material included in this repository.

data/body_muscles.json
----------------------
SVG path data for the front and back muscle figures.

  Source:  https://github.com/vulovix/body-muscles
  Licence: Apache License 2.0 — full text in data/body_muscles.LICENSE

Changes from the original: the TypeScript muscle definitions were converted to
JSON, keeping only each shape's id, name and path. The original rendering code,
colour handling and grouping are not used. The mapping from Liftosaur muscle
names to these shapes (body_map.py), the colour scale and the rendering in
index.html are this project's own work.

data/exercises.ts
-----------------
Exercise-to-muscle data used to build muscle_map.json.

  Source:  https://github.com/astashov/liftosaur (src/data/exercises.ts)
  Licence: AGPL-3.0

Only the target and synergist muscle lists are read from this file, at build
time, to produce muscle_map.json. No Liftosaur source code is distributed here.
